<title>DENMARK: Landwirtschaftliche raises 4-pct bond offer.</title>
<headline>Landwirtschaftliche raises 4-pct bond offer.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>German borrower Landwirtschaftliche Rentenbank has increased to 360 million Danish crowns from 260 million its four-percent bond, due 2003, arranger Dresdner Bank said in statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The issue is to be listed on the Copenhagen stock exchange on December 5, 1996.</p>
<p>--Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
